# A carriage return on a shell script's shebang line makes SteamOS report
# "bad interpreter" (docs/CROSS_MACHINE_RIG.md section 3). core.autocrlf=true on
# this machine would materialise CRLF in a fresh checkout, so shell scripts are
# pinned to LF in the working tree as well as in the index.
*.sh text eol=lf
